        "type": "reg",
        "input": "2\n3 1\n000\n2 0\n11",
        "output": "00\n11",
        "explanation": "Explanation:\nTest case 111: Alice will select index 111 and remove S1S_1S1​. The resulting string is 000000.\nTest case 222: Alice cannot perform any operation. The resulting string is 111111."
      }
    ]
